1}{16} = \\frac{1}{2} \\ln 2 - \\frac{5}{16}\n$$\n\nNow compute numerically:\n\n$ \\ln 2 \\approx 0.6931 $, so $ \\frac{1}{2} \\ln 2 \\approx 0.34655 $\n\n$ \\frac{5}{16} = 0.3125 $\n\nSo $ I \\approx 0.34655 - 0.3125 = 0.03405 $\n\nSo approximately 0.034\n\nThus the answer is **J. 0.034**\n\n\\boxed{J}",
