    "global index": "MMLUPro_math_6580",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: If I roll 5 standard 6-sided dice and multiply the number on the face of each die, what is the probability that the result is a composite number?\n\nOptions: \nA. \\frac{{8}}{{7776}}\nB. \\frac{{243}}{{486}}\nC. \\frac{{32}}{{7776}}\nD. \\frac{{400}}{{7776}}\nE. \\frac{{1}}{{486}}\nF. \\frac{{4}}{{7776}}\nG. \\frac{{16}}{{7776}}\nH. \\frac{{100}}{{7776}}\nI. \\frac{{2}}{{7776}}\nJ. \\frac{{485}}{{486}}\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
