      "generated_answer": "The external volume is \\( 3.3 \\times 2.6 \\times 1.3 = 11.154 \\, \\text{m}^3 \\) or \\( 11154 \\, \\text{liters} \\).  \nThe internal capacity is \\( 8000 \\, \\text{liters} \\), so internal volume is \\( 8 \\, \\text{m}^3 \\).  \nThe walls are 5 cm thick, so internal length = \\( 3.3 - 0.1 = 3.2 \\) m, width = \\( 2.6 - 0.1 = 2.5 \\) m.  \n\nLet bottom thickness be \\( t \\) m, so internal height = \\( 1.3 - t \\).  \nThen \\( 3.2 \\times 2.5 \\times (1.3 - t) = 8 \\) → \\( 1.3 - t = 1 \\) → \\( t = 0.3 \\, \\text{m} = 3 \\, \\text{dm} \\).  \n\nCorrect choice:  \n\\boxed{B}",
