      "generated_answer": "The set has $ 2^5 = 32 $ total subsets, including the null set. We want subsets where the largest element is 4 or 5. Subsets with largest number 4 must include 4 and only elements from {1,2,3}, giving $ 2^3 = 8 $ subsets. Subsets with largest number 5 must include 5 and any subset of {1,2,3,4}, giving $ 2^4 = 16 $ subsets. Total favorable subsets: $ 8 + 16 = 24 $, so probability is $ \\frac{24}{32} = \\frac{3}{4} $.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
