    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10772",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Let F= kr^nr̂ Evaluate \\int\\int_sF\\bullet n̂dsand \\int\\int_sF× n̂ds wheres is a sphere of radius a centered at the origin.\n\nOptions: \nA. 2\\pi k a^n+3, -1\nB. 4\\pi k a^n+2, 0\nC. 2\\pi k a^n+2, 0\nD. 6\\pi k a^n+2, \\pi\nE. 3\\pi k a^n+1, \\pi a^n\nF. 4\\pi k a^n+3, 1\nG. 4\\pi k a^n, 0\nH. 4\\pi k a^n-1, 0\nI. 2\\pi k a^n, 2\\pi a^n\nJ. 4\\pi k a^n+1, 0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
