    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A Gaussian filter with \\vertH(\\omega)\\vert^2 = e^-(\\omega)2 is used to filter noise at the output of an amplifier stage. Determine the bandwidth of the filter.\n\nOptions: \nA. (1 / 3\\surd\\pi)\nB. (3 / 4√π)\nC. (1 / 6√π)\nD. (2 / √π)\nE. (1 / 4\\surd\\pi)\nF. (1 / 2\\surd\\pi)\nG. (1 / 8√π)\nH. (1 / √π)\nI. (1 / 5\\surd\\pi)\nJ. (1 / 7√π)\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
