    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: If the speed of an airplane is measured by means of a stagnation tube, what correction must be applied to the constant-density indication when the plane is cruising at 300 mph?\n\nOptions: \nA. - 10 mph\nB. 25 mph\nC. -30 mph\nD. -15 mph\nE. - 5 mph\nF. 10 mph\nG. 5 mph\nH. 0 mph\nI. 15 mph\nJ. -20 mph\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
