    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A response transformV_ab(s) is related to a source transform V(s) by V_ab(s) = [{{3V(s) + 3s + 27}} / (s^2 + 6s + 8)] Findv_ab(t) if v(t) = 16e^-3tu(t).\n\nOptions: \nA. - 48e^-3t - (68 / 2)e^-2t + (33 / 2)e^-4t\nB. 16e^-3t + (69 / 2)e^-2t + (33 / 2)e^-4t\nC. - 48e^-3t+ (69 / 2)e^-2t + (33 / 3)e^-4t\nD. - 48e^-3t+ (70 / 2)e^-2t + (33 / 2)e^-4t\nE. - 49e^-3t + (69 / 2)e^-2t + (33 / 2)e^-4t\nF. - 48e^-3t + (69 / 2)e^-2t - (33 / 2)e^-4t\nG. 48e^-3t - (69 / 2)e^-2t - (33 / 2)e^-4t\nH. - 48e^-3t+ (69 / 2)e^-2t + (34 / 2)e^-4t\nI. - 48e^-3t + (70 / 2)e^-2t + (34 / 2)e^-4t\nJ. - 48e^-3t+ (69 / 2)e^-2t + (33 / 2)e^-4t\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
