  {
    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10620",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A dc motor requires 10 kilowatts to enable it to supply its full capacity of 10 horsepower to its pulley. What is its full-load efficiency ?\n\nOptions: \nA. 74.6%\nB. 65%\nC. 50%\nD. 85%\nE. 92%\nF. 60%\nG. 80%\nH. 70%\nI. 90%\nJ. 78.2%\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "First, convert the output power:  \n10 horsepower = 10 × 745.7 W = 7,457 W ≈ 7.457 kW.  \n\nInput power is given as 10 kW, so efficiency = \\( \\frac{7.457}{10} \\) ≈ 0.7457 or 74.57%.  \n\nThis matches closest to **74.6%** in the options.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{A}",
