      "generated_answer": "Upon realizing that the book does not have a usable narrative and cannot be turned into a film, Charlie is left with a serious case of writer's block. This paralyzes his progress on the screenplay, despite being well past his deadline. His struggle is compounded by his despair over self-referential writing and inability to adapt the source material faithfully.\n\n\\boxed{{writer's block}}",
