      "generated_answer": "After Cesar created graffiti of a dead dog, he was shot with a morphine-filled arrow, passed out, and woke up to find one of his fingers cut off as a warning. The finger was later reattached, and it was revealed that Garfield was responsible. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Cesar was drugged with a morphine arrow and had a finger cut off as a warning, which was later reattached.}}",
