    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: When the Spanish explorer Hernando de Soto crossed a portion of the North American continent, his expedition encountered direct descendants of which people?\n\nOptions: \nA. Mayan\nB. Kwakiutl\nC. Mississippian\nD. Inca\nE. Clovis\nF. Aztec\nG. Ancestral Puebloan\nH. Hopewell\nI. Olmec\nJ. Adena\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
