    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What did the Moche build at the heart of their urban center?\n\nOptions: \nA. the Temple of the Feathered Serpent\nB. an enormous walled-in precinct of elite residences\nC. the Palace of the Painted Walls\nD. a complex irrigation system\nE. the Pyramid of the Sun\nF. the Tower of Moche\nG. an extensive library of their written records\nH. a central marketplace for trade\nI. a vast complex of temples and artisan workshops\nJ. an amphitheater for gladiatorial combats\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
