      "generated_answer": "The passage emphasizes that perestroika is an \"urgent necessity\" and that delays could lead to \"serious social, economic, and political crises.\" This indicates that Gorbachev believed restructuring was needed to prevent such crises. Therefore, the best inference is that restructuring was necessary to avoid a crisis.\n\n\\boxed{H}",
