    "global index": "MMLUPro_history_4473",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: One of the less obvious reasons for the Inca to fight so many wars may have been:\n\nOptions: \nA. to demonstrate their military prowess to potential allies and enemies.\nB. to expand their empire's territory.\nC. to unite their own population through a common enemy.\nD. to identify and cultivate talented leaders.\nE. to gain control of vital resources.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
