    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{J}\n\nThis is the most accurate because it directly reflects the historical development of the first U.S. political parties, which emerged from constitutional debates over federal power, states' rights, and economic visions in the 1790s, forming around figures like Hamilton (Federalists) and Jefferson (Democratic-Republicans).",
