      "generated_answer": "Logan’s speech expresses a sense of profound injustice and a desire for retribution after suffering a grievous wrong, despite previous peaceful relations—a dynamic most analogous to the position of oppressed groups seeking civil rights through protest in the 1960s.  \n\n**Correct answer:** \\boxed{E}",
