      "generated_answer": "Based on historical context, the 1840s saw the Oregon Trail migration increase and, after 1848, the California Gold Rush surge dramatically. The best choice is the one reflecting a shift toward California later in the decade.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{C}",
