    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The passage describes Rome’s internal decay and military decline leading to barbarian invasions, a pattern also seen in Han China, where collapse disrupted overland Silk Road trade and shifted commerce toward Indian Ocean sea routes.  \n\nCorrect answer: \\boxed{B}",
